
What is IDLE?
IDLE stands for Integrated DeveLopment Environment. It is an IDE for Python, written in Python language itself and based on Tkinter with bindings to the Tk widget set. IDLE is most suitable for beginners as it has a simple IDE feature list. Hence, it is very popular in educational environments.

sudo apt-get install idle3  = for python 3.x

sudo apt-get install idle   = for python 2.x


